{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/loginexchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginExchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginExchange"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Opens the envelope, producing ","type":"text"},{"code":"KE3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"title":"finish(password:ke2:ksf:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"password"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ke2"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ksf"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV","text":"KsfParams"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13LoginExchangeC6finish8password3ke23ksfS2S_SSAA9KsfParamsVtKF"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"finish","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ke2","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ksf","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV","text":"KsfParams","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A failure here is the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"whole"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of the client’s authentication check, and covers both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves of the mutual authentication: the envelope only opens under the right password, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"type":"text","text":"’s MAC only verifies if the server actually holds the record. Nothing may be sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"afterwards (§23.4 rule 7)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether the caller is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"finished"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is a separate question, and one this type deliberately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not answer: under an ","type":"text"},{"code":"optional","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tenant a failure here is the ordinary case for an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account that has no registration record yet, and §23.4 rule 7 requires a retry over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/auth\/login","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". That branch needs the ","type":"text"},{"code":"mode","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field from the ","type":"text"},{"code":"login\/start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" response, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it lives in ","type":"text"},{"code":"AxiamClient.loginOpaque","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where the response is; the error raised here is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same one either way.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That case is an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", unlike every other refusal in this package. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinction is the point: a wrong password, an account that does not exist and a server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that does not hold the record are indistinguishable by design and are all authentication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failures, whereas a key-stretching function this build cannot perform is a configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"problem, and reporting it as “invalid password” would send an operator looking in the wrong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the envelope does not open or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"type":"text","text":" does not verify."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)"},{"text":" if the exchange is already spent, or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key-stretching function is one this SDK cannot ask for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws"}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/KsfParams":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The key-stretching function and cost a "},{"code":"\/start","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" response names (CONTRACT.md §23.4)."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KsfParams","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"KsfParams","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ksfparams","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KsfParams","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/network(_:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"AxiamError.network(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"network"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12NetworkErrorV","text":"NetworkError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Transport-level failure: connection refused, timeout, TLS error, DNS failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"malformed request, server (5xx) error.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamerror\/network(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/auth(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Authentication failure: wrong credentials, expired session, MFA failure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or a 401 on the refresh call itself."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"auth"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9AuthErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"